@startuml system-workflow-simple
title Secure Vibe Delivery — Workflow (simplified)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF7E0
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0C46C

actor "Developer" as User #ECEFF1
participant "AI Assistant" as AST #E3F2FD
participant "MCP Server" as MCP #E8F5E9
participant "Run Pipeline" as PIPE #FFF3E0
participant "Checks" as CHK #F3E5F5
participant "Local Toolchain" as TOOLS #E3F2FD
boundary "Snyk · Semgrep ·\nTest environment" as EXT #ECEFF1
participant "Gate & Report" as GR #E8F5E9

User -> AST : "check this project"

== Step 1 — Start the run ==
AST -> MCP : svd_run
MCP -> PIPE : start background job
MCP --> AST : **run_id**

== Step 2 — Run the three checks ==
PIPE -> CHK : security · functional · performance
CHK -> TOOLS : run scanners, tests, Locust
TOOLS -> EXT : HTTPS · load test
TOOLS --> CHK : results
AST -> MCP : svd_status (polling)

== Step 3 — Decide and report ==
PIPE -> GR : results
GR -> GR : **verdict** + **HTML report**
GR --> User : opens report
AST --> User : 📄 verdict and must-fix list

note across
  Snyk is reached only through the local Snyk CLI, and the assistant polls
  the background run. Full sequence: system-workflow.png
end note

@enduml
